The post is currently ranked number 17 for the week on that platform. However, the source material provided consists only of a moderator comment requesting that the original poster include code, math, or implementation details alongside rendered images. The comment explicitly asks the author to copy the text from the underlying post and provide any details interesting to graphics programmers.

