No specific technical implementation, code snippets, or mathematical formulas are present in the available text. Consequently, the bulletin cannot describe how the setup works or who specifically it is for beyond the general context of Unity HDRP development. The lack of implementation details in the provided source prevents a full technical breakdown of the ray-tracing method used for the splats and meshes.

